PROPOSED PROPRIETARY SOFTWARE TERMS — DRAFT FOR LEGAL REVIEW

This file is a discussion draft only. It has not been approved by legal counsel,
does not establish who owns any particular work, and is not evidence of an
assignment or licence.

For source material that is independently verified as owned or controlled by
the authorized VELORI rights holder, the intended distribution model is
proprietary. No permission to copy, modify, redistribute, sublicense, or create
derivative works from such verified first-party material is intended to be
granted by this draft. Any permitted use must be stated in a separate written
licence from an authorized rights holder.

This draft does not apply to third-party dependencies, fonts, icons, images,
video, templates, generated or imported content, or any other material whose
rights are held by another person or remain uncertain. Those materials remain
subject to their own applicable terms. This draft does not remove or replace
required third-party notices.

Before adoption, counsel and the authorized rights holder must review the
ownership evidence, distribution model, required licence grants, consumer and
privacy terms, jurisdiction, contact details, and third-party obligations.
